# Final Showdown's second mode ({W} + {1}): "Choose a creature you control. It gains indestructible until end of turn." Bot1 has two
# Ornithopters; the mode resolves and Bot1 chooses the second (not a target: the choice is made as it resolves, CR 608.2d). Bot2 then
# bolts both: the chosen one survives its three damage (CR 702.12b, 704.5g: indestructible creatures aren't destroyed by damage) and
# the other dies.

